# FSD (Vue)

Layers (top → bottom): `app` → `pages` → `widgets` → `features` → `entities` → `shared`.

- Import only downward. No cross-imports between slices of the same layer.
- Public API of a slice: `index.ts` only. No deep-imports of internals.
- Pinia store lives in the slice that owns the state (`model/`), not `src/stores/`.
- Pages compose widgets/features; user actions in `features`; pure domain in `entities`/`shared`.
